# FEFF run output. examples/ execute in the working directory, so FEFF drops
# log.dat, per-module logN.dat and its data files in the repository root.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash: unanchored patterns match at every level and
# would also ignore tests/fixtures/aggregate_paths/, where files.dat and
# feff0001.dat are irreplaceable golden fixtures. Already-tracked files would
# survive, but a newly added fixture would be silently skipped.
/log.dat
/log[0-9]*.dat
/feff.inp
/xmu.dat
/chi.dat
/files.dat
/paths.dat
/feff[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].dat
